            <ArticleTitle>Phase I 1/2 evaluation and methodology of RO 20-2230 in postoperative patients.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>113-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This report presents the rationale and methodology of our &quot;phase 1 1/2&quot; model for drug evaluation and reports the results of a typical study. We found that Ro 20-2230, and investigational agonist-antagonist analgesic, was well tolerated in therapeutic doses, with 15 mg intramuscular Ro 20-2230 approximately equivalent to 10 mg intramuscular morphine sulfate.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
